Hope Society Pakistan/src/components/PageHero.astro" data-astro-source-loc="11:111">About us</span></nav> <h1 class="h1" data-astro-cid-s5hxusys data-astro-source-file="C:/Projects/Hope Society Pakistan/src/components/PageHero.astro" data-astro-source-loc="12:22">Since<br data-astro-cid-s5hxusys data-astro-source-file="C:/Projects/Hope Society Pakistan/src/components/PageHero.astro" data-astro-source-loc="12:43"><span class="gold" data-astro-cid-s5hxusys data-astro-source-file="C:/Projects/Hope Society Pakistan/src/components/PageHero.astro" data-astro-source-loc="12:67">2021.</span></h1> <p class="lede" style="margin:28px 0 0;color:rgba(255,255,255,.8);max-width:540px" data-astro-cid-s5hxusys data-astro-source-file="C:/Projects/Hope Society Pakistan/src/components/PageHero.astro" data-astro-source-loc="13:99">A youth-led federation of chapters and campus embassies, rebuilding Pakistan through conscious youth, intellectual growth and responsible leadership.</p> </div> <div class="img arch" data-astro-cid-s5hxusys data-astro-source-file="C:/Projects/Hope Society Pakistan/src/components/PageHero.astro" data-astro-source-loc="16:30"><div class="photo " data-astro-source-file="C:/Projects/Hope Society Pakistan/src/components/Photo.astro" data-astro-source-loc="9:29"> <img src="/images/monument-backs.jpg" alt loading="eager" decoding="async" data-astro-source-file="C:/Projects/Hope Society Pakistan/src/components/Photo.astro" data-astro-source-loc="11:8"> </div></div> </div> </section>  <section class="wrap" style="padding-top:clamp(72px,9vw,128px);padding-bottom:clamp(72px,9vw,128px)" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r data-astro-source-file="C:/Projects/Hope Society Pakistan/src/pages/about.astro" data-astro-source-loc="22:104"> <div class="grid-auto" style="--min:300px;--gap:56px;align-items:start" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r data-astro-source-file="C:/Projects/Hope Society Pakistan/src/pages/about.astro" data-astro-source-loc="23:77"> <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;max-width:380px" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r data-astro-source-file="C:/Projects/Hope Society Pakistan/src/pages/about.astro" data-astro-source-loc="24:80"> <div style="aspect-ratio:4/5;border-radius:24px;overflow:hidden" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r data-astro-source-file="C:/Projects/Hope Society Pakistan/src/pages/about.astro" data-astro-source-loc="25:75"><div class="photo " data-astro-source-file="C:/Projects/Hope Society Pakistan/src/components/Photo.astro" data-astro-source-loc="9:29"> <img src="/images/chairman.png" alt loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-astro-source-file="C:/Projects/Hope Society Pakistan/src/components/Photo.astro" data-astro-source-loc="11:8"> </div></div> <div data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r data-astro-source-file="C:/Projects/Hope Society Pakistan/src/pages/about.astro" data-astro-source-loc="26:15"><div style="font-weight:700;font-size:17px" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r data-astro-source-file="C:/Projects/Hope Society Pakistan/src/pages/about.astro" data-astro-source-loc="26:58">Husayn Paras Naqvi</div><div class="muted" style="font-size:14px" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r data-astro-source-file="C:/Projects/Hope Society Pakistan/src/pages/about.astro" data-astro-source-loc="26:121">Chairman, Hope Society Pakistan</div></div> </div> <div class="span2 min0" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r data-astro-source-file="C:/Projects/Hope Society Pakistan/src/pages/about.astro" data-astro-source-loc="28:31"> <div class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:22px" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r data-astro-source-file="C:/Projects/Hope Society Pakistan/src/pages/about.astro" data-astro-source-loc="29:57">Preamble · from the chairman</div> <p class="navy" style="margin:0;font-size:clamp(24px,2.8vw,38px);line-height:1.28;font-weight:500;text-wrap:pretty" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r data-astro-source-file="C:/Projects/Hope Society Pakistan/src/pages/about.astro" data-astro-source-loc="30:125">“The connection between organisation and ideology is like the body and the soul. The body moves in service of the spirit, and the soul makes its home in the body.”</p> <p class="body" style="margin:28px 0 0;line-height:1.7;max-width:640px" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r data-astro-source-file="C:/Projects/Hope Society Pakistan/src/pages/about.astro" data-astro-source-loc="31:81">HOPE is both a movement and a school of thought. Our structure welcomes everyone who believes in inclusivity; our ideas give every member the intellectual nourishment to lead. The manifesto is our shared guide to doing that work with excellence, at every step.</p> <a href="/library" class="link-underline" style="margin-top:24px" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r data-astro-source-file="C:/Projects/Hope Society Pakistan/src/pages/about.astro" data-astro-source-loc="32:75">Read the full manifesto</a> </div> </div> </section> <section class="bg-navy rel" style="overflow:hidden" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r data-astro-source-file="C:/Projects/Hope Society Pakistan/src/pages/about.astro" data-astro-source-loc="37:56"> <div class="rays" style="left:50%;bottom:-700px;width:1400px;height:1400px;transform:translateX(-50%);background:repeating-conic-gradient(rgba(246,194,50,.13) 0deg .9deg,transparent .9deg 6deg);-webkit-mask:radial-gradient(circle,transparent 0 12%,#000 13% 40%,transparent 60%);mask:radial-gradient(circle,transparent 0 12%,#000 13% 40%,transparent 60%)" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r data-astro-source-file="C:/Projects/Hope Society Pakistan/src/pages/about.astro" data-astro-source-loc="38:6"></div> <div class="wrap rel" style="padding-top:clamp(72px,9vw,128px);padding-bottom:clamp(72px,9vw,128px)" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r data-astro-source-file="C:/Projects/Hope Society Pakistan/src/pages/about.astro" data-astro-source-loc="39:106"> <div style="text-align:center;max-width:760px;margin:0 auto 64px" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r data-astro-source-file="C:/Projects/Hope Society Pakistan/src/pages/about.astro" data-astro-source-loc="40:73"> <div class="eyebrow gold" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r data-astro-source-file="C:/Projects/Hope Society Pakistan/src/pages/about.astro" data-astro-source-loc="41:35">Our philosophy</div> <h2 class="display h2-xl" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r data-astro-source-file="C:/Projects/Hope Society Pakistan/src/pages/about.astro" data-astro-source-loc="42:35">Three pillars of an ideal society</h2> </div> <div class="grid-auto reveal" style="--min:380px;--gap:2px;border-radius:28px;overflow:hidden" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r data-astro-source-file="C:/Projects/Hope Society Pakistan/src/pages/about.astro" data-astro-source-loc="44:102"> <div class="pil" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r data-astro-source-file="C:/Projects/Hope Society Pakistan/src/pages/about.astro" data-astro-source-loc="45:27"><div class="pil-word gold" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r data-astro-source-file="C:/Projects/Hope Society Pakistan/src/pages/about.astro" data-astro-source-loc="45:53">Awareness</div><p data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r data-astro-source-file="C:/Projects/Hope Society Pakistan/src/pages/about.astro" data-astro-source-loc="45:71">More than knowing: the ability to turn knowledge into practice and decide with insight. Awareness frees people from blind imitation and gives them critical thought. One conscious person can redirect an unconscious crowd.</p></div> <div class="pil" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r data-astro-source-file="C:/Projects/Hope Society Pakistan/src/pages/about.astro" data-astro-source-loc="46:27"><div class="pil-word" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r data-astro-source-file="C:/Projects/Hope Society Pakistan/src/pages/about.astro" data-astro-source-loc="46:48">Character</div><p data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r data-astro-source-file="C:/Projects/Hope Society Pakistan/src/pages/about.astro" data-astro-source-loc="46:66">The discipline to act on your principles when no one is watching. Character is the quiet consistency between what a Hopian believes and what a Hopian does, and it's what makes trust between people, and within a team, possible.</p></div> <div class="pil" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r data-astro-source-file="C